# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

collatz is project
collatz purpose "Count Collatz steps and sum digits, exiting with a computed code; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
collatz target console
collatz version "0.1.0"
collatz language refined 1
collatz standardLibrary 1
collatz allows write console.stdout none
collatz requires none
collatz includesModule collatz
collatz entry collatz.main
